WEBVTT

00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:15,670
Sometimes the ball gets so hot I will set it on the floor beside our bed. Is this okay to do?

00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,890
Is it still effective next to our bed?

00:00:18,590 --> 00:00:24,430
Yes, it is. But remember the farther the bulb is away to

00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:27,910
your body, the you are

00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:32,510
losing effectiveness.

00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:35,830
So if you're too hot, I always

00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:42,310
recommend that you just move the ball maybe a foot away from you on your bed.

00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:48,790
Even if you're sleeping in a single bed, you should still be able to be lying comfortable with

00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:57,670
the ball a foot away from you in bed. If if you're putting it on the floor beside your bed,

00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:05,430
you're still getting some benefits. I will say that. We've had some line patients that have

00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:12,550
had to put the bulb in the next room and run it and go slowly in the kill program in order to get

00:01:13,510 --> 00:01:20,950
to where they're not herxied enough where they can bring it into the room. However, it is

00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:26,710
when you're trying to kill cancer patients, you're not worried about herxia, you're concerned

00:01:26,710 --> 00:01:35,270
about the heat of the bulb and it's discomfort because you're warm. But you so you need it

00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:44,790
is close to you as possible. But that being said, yes, you could put it 12 to 18 inches away from you

00:01:47,110 --> 00:01:53,270
and try to be as comfortable as possible. If it's three feet on the floor and it's going

00:01:53,270 --> 00:01:57,270
partially through the mattress to get to you, it's definitely going to have some filtration

00:01:57,990 --> 00:02:00,470
and you're going to definitely lose some effectiveness.

